# House Targaryen, from Aegon the Conqueror to Daenerys and Jon Snow.
# George R. R. Martin, A Song of Ice and Fire; Fire & Blood (2018); The World of Ice and
# Fire (2014). Cross-checked against Wikidata (House Targaryen, P53, with P22/P25).
# A fun example, not clinical data. Bloodline only: married-in spouses appear as
# founders and childless marriages (Maegor's six wives, Baelor and Daena) are left out.
# Children are listed by the father officially recorded: Laenor Velaryon for Rhaenyra's
# three eldest sons, Aegon IV for Daeron II. Jon Snow's parentage is from the TV series.
# PHENO 2 = the "Targaryen madness" (Aerys II, Aerion Brightflame).
